# Copy to .dev.vars (not committed) for `npm run dev`. Use your own local values here;
# the live site reads its own values from Cloudflare secrets (`npx wrangler secret put NAME`).
# ADMIN_CODE and SIGNUP_CODE: at least 4 characters. SESSION_SECRET and PIN_SALT: at least 32 random characters.
ADMIN_CODE=
SESSION_SECRET=
PIN_SALT=
SIGNUP_CODE=
